"entity": {
"name": "HNI Corporation",
"description": "HNI Corp. engages in the provision of workplace furnishings and residential building products. It operates through the Workplace Furnishing and Residential Building Products segments. The Workplace Furnishings segment manufactures and markets a broad line of commercial and home office furniture, which includes panel-based and freestanding furniture systems, seating, storage, tables, and architectural products. The Residential Building Products segment manufactures and markets a full array of gas, wood, electric, and pellet fueled fireplaces, inserts, stoves, facings, and accessories. The company was founded by C. Maxwell Stanley, Clem Hanson, and H. Wood Miller in 1944 and is headquartered in Muscatine, IA.",
